				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">All share numbers on these cover pages are presented as shares of Class A common stock, par value $0.001 per share (the "Class A Shares") of Carvana Co., a Delaware corporation (the "Issuer"), on an as-converted basis from Class A common units ("Class A Units") of Carvana Group, LLC, a Delaware limited liability company ("Carvana Group") and subsidiary of the Issuer, as further described herein.

